	quest.003E91B7BC774A6A.quest_desc: [
		"This remote is truly wireless, as it claims, but it requires a bit more setup. To start, bind the advanced wireless terminal to the storage or crafting terminal with a shift-right-click. This will give you a range of 64 blocks."
		""
		"Stage 2 of the advanced wireless terminal will grant you wireless access anywhere in the same dimension as the terminal, provided the system is chunk-loaded or loaded. To achieve stage 2, you must build an active level 1 beacon within 8 blocks of the grid it is linked to. You'll see an indicator in the wireless terminal if it's in range and worked."
		""
		"Stage 3 of the advanced wireless terminal grants access anywhere in any dimension, provided the terminal it is linked to is loaded or chunk-loaded. This requires you to upgrade the beacon to a level 4 beacon (max size), and it must be within 8 blocks of the terminal it is linked to."
		""
		"If you are in a team, it is recommended you link all teammates' remotes to separate terminals, as they essentially open the terminal they are linked to. So, anything in the crafting grid of your advanced wireless terminal will show up in the crafting terminal's crafting grid it's linked to."
	]
	quest.003E91B7BC774A6A.quest_subtitle: "Click to learn more!"
	quest.0088ED553938E5FE.quest_subtitle: "Fast and fairly reliable. Make sure your runway is long enough."
	quest.00ABFB0F22459983.quest_desc: [
		"&bUltimine&r allows for breaking multiple blocks simultaneously in a variety of patterns. If you want to dig a vein of ores, use &bUltimine&r!"
		""
		"Using &bUltimine&r is as simple as pressing its keybind (Default: '&b~&r') and breaking a block!"
		""
		"Holding down &bUltimine&r, pressing '&bShift&r', and scrolling will allow you to change the pattern in which &bUltimine&r destroys blocks."
		""
		"&4Be careful&r! &bUltimine&r can quick deplete your food or break your tools!"
	]
	quest.00ABFB0F22459983.quest_subtitle: "Click to learn more!"
	quest.00EBDE8B17E1EB99.quest_subtitle: "&bArid, Grassland"
	quest.00F52023D5062BFA.title: "Find a Bat"
	quest.01191530E736630B.quest_desc: ["Ever wanted to power an electric motor from a steam engine's alternator in an entirely different dimension? Now you can."]
	quest.01191530E736630B.quest_subtitle: "FE and AE"
	quest.01330815BDF90886.quest_subtitle: "Spawns mainly in jungle biomes."
	quest.014142C8055CDECF.quest_desc: ["The tag filter enables you to insert an item to view its tags, then you can set specific tags from that item to the allow or disallow list. This can be especially useful for automating processes such as furnaces. For instance, you can set the tag to only allow \"raw_ore,\" ensuring that the system automatically puts anything with the \"raw_ore\" tag into the furnace and nothing else. This can significantly save time compared to using the normal item filter for a bulk of items."]
	quest.014142C8055CDECF.quest_subtitle: "Click to learn more!"
	quest.01433AC34119B783.quest_subtitle: "Found in Jungle Pyramids."
	quest.01B1A529336DC9BE.quest_subtitle: "Perfect for building, and that's about it."
	quest.01B1D9F128FFC4C9.quest_desc: [
		"&6Brass Casing&r can be crafted by:"
		""
		"Right-clicking a &bStripped Log&r with an &bBrass Ingot&r."
	]
	quest.01B1D9F128FFC4C9.quest_subtitle: "The primary building block for late-game automation."
	quest.01DCF871845A9E26.quest_desc: [
		"The &6Printer&r allows you to duplicate &bEnchanted Books&r, &bName Tags&r, &bTrain Schedules&r, and more!"
		""
		"&6Printers&r can be crafted with:"
		""
		"1x &bCopper Casing&r"
		"1x &bDried Kelp&r"
		"1x &bIron Sheet&r"
	]
	quest.01DCF871845A9E26.quest_subtitle: "Click to learn more!"
	quest.01F8BADC30C09DF8.quest_desc: [
		"Legendary &cPokémon&r are incredibly rare and powerful creatures that can be encountered randomly throughout your journey, depending on the biome you're in."
		""
		"Catching these elusive beings can be quite challenging, so make sure to grab &bMaster Balls&r whenever possible, either through crafting or completing quests."
		""
		"If you're searching for a specific &cPokémon&r, don't forget to use your &bCobbledex&r! It will tell you exactly which biomes to look in."
		""
		"&9Legendary Pokémon are added via datapacks. Before playing, make sure you have them installed by running /datapack list. Confirm \"BCG x AllTheMons\" is included. If you need assistance, feel free to join the Discord!&r"
	]
	quest.01F8BADC30C09DF8.quest_subtitle: "Click to learn more!"
	quest.022BD687682D4A21.quest_subtitle: "Ah! It grew legs!"
	quest.023127E78954A961.title: "Obtain Each Tera Shard"
