	quest.0254C97DC04F0361.title: "Obtain 256x Cherry Log"
	quest.0292F734F71E37C2.quest_desc: [
		"The level emitter functions by emitting a redstone signal when a specific item has reached a particular amount, set by the player. It operates in two modes:"
		""
		"Emit when there is More than"
		"Emit when there is Less than"
		""
		"These modes are useful for setups to either deactivate when reaching a certain threshold or activate automation when falling below a designated mark."
	]
	quest.0292F734F71E37C2.quest_subtitle: "Click to learn more!"
	quest.02AF54D55FF5C84F.quest_desc: [
		"To My Discord Staff: &6Kurisu&r, &dBlacknewt&r, &dHarold&r, &dHolland&r, &dSinnamoth&r, and &cLion&r,"
		""
		"Thank you so much for everything you do! Your assistance in maintaining a helpful and safe community makes my life much easier. I could not do it without you."
		""
		"To &eMod Developers&r:"
		""
		"A big thank you to the backbone of the modding community, your creations help expand on the greatest game ever made."
		""
		"To &9Craft Down Under&r:"
		""
		"Thank you for being with me since day one! Sauramel and Olivia, our partnership has meant the most, and I'm so thankful you two reached out when you did. It was a wonderful introduction to the modded Minecraft community!"
		""
		"To My &bLuna Pixel&r Buddies:"
		""
		"Your guidance and kindness have been invaluable during my journey as a modpack developer. I am deeply grateful for our friendship."
		""
		"To &aV4lk&r:"
		""
		"Thank you for your contributions to BCG's art! Your work has played a significant role in bringing joy to thousands of people!"
		""
		"To &5KaptainWutax&r:"
		""
		"Your expertise in mod development has taken BCG to a whole new level, I sincerely thank you for everything you've helped build."
		""
		"To &9Ardy&r, &9Baguette&r, and &9Tom&r:"
		""
		"Thank you for the assistance with quests! You know I absolutely love doing them LOL."
		""
		"To &cbndf88&r:"
		""
		"Thanks for the music, sucker."
		""
		"To &2George Cooper&r: A devoted husband to Mary, a loving father to Sheldon, George Jr., and Missy, and a passionate football coach who inspired many. He was known for his love of brisket and his unwavering support for his family. His legacy of love, dedication, and strength will forever be remembered."
		""
		"And finally, thank &6YOU&r for playing! Your support means the world, and I'm so blessed to be in a position where I can do this full-time. Seriously, I suck at thank-yous, but genuinely, from the bottom of my heart, thank you."
	]
