	quest.0661DD36D8711ADA.quest_desc: ["Throw a block of &3Certus&r and a &bCharged Certus&r into a pool of water and it will convert to a &9Budding Certus&r block. It grows like &5Budding Amythest&r, but decays in quality over time until its no longer budding. Do it again to improve the quality."]
