	quest.143C1FFF1C05FC2C.quest_desc: [
		"The Galley is tailored for warm water environments and naval warfare."
		""
		"It features impressive maneuverability, and a top speed of 40 km/h."
		""
		"With seating for 9 passengers, including the captain, and a hull strength of 200 HP, it proves to be a promising vessel in various situations."
	]
