	quest.2E1AF3C41847180E.title: "Mechanical Leather Wings"
	quest.2E3C01C71D2B61D8.quest_subtitle: "The core component for logistical machinery!"
	quest.2E4122CDAAC87396.quest_desc: [
		"ME, short for Matter-to-Energy, is the main method of storage and logistics in AE2."
		""
		"Cells work kind of like a row of Storage Drawers on a Controller, if they could cannibalize empty drawers for more space."
		""
		"Cells have 2 important stats. &3Type Slots&r (read \"Drawers\") and &3Bytes&r a number of stacks of 8 or less a cell can store. Each Type Slot gets a number of Bytes based on the size of the cell (like stack upgrades)."
		""
		"So a 1K cell has 1000 Bytes (hence the name) and thus stores a maximum of 8000 items. And, if all those items can stack together as a single \"Type,\" it does, that Type's excess overflowing into all the remaining empty Type Slots's \"drawers\" to claim their Byte space."
		""
		"&lBUT&r, &aadding a new Type costs 1 Type Slot amount of Bytes&r."
		"So for instance storing a stack of Birch Wood in a 1K cell costs 16 Bytes (&58&r+&d8&r), not just 8. But storing a second stack of Birch only costs 8, for a total of 24 (&58&r+&d8&r+&d8&r)."
		"But if it were Oak Wood instead, it would cost 32 (&58&r+&d8&r)+(&58&r+&d8&r) Bytes total."
		""
		"Adding just single item to it empty costs 9 (&58&r+&d1&r), and would continue to cost 9 until it hit 9 total items, where it would bump up to 10 (&58&r+&d1&r+&d1&r)."
		"And if it were a 4K cell, which has 32 bytes per Type, that single item would cost 33 (&532&r+&d1&r)."
	]
	quest.2E976AB705F26470.quest_desc: [
		"&6Item Vaults&r are the intended storage system in &6BigChadGuys Plus&r. Each &6Vault&r can hold up to 30x items."
		""
		"Make sure to pair your &6Item Vaults&r with:"
		""
		"{ \"text\": \"Tom's Simple Storage\", \"color\": \"aqua\", \"underlined\": \"true\", \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"74D3F94AF49EECCF\" } }"
		""
		"&6Item Vaults&r can be crafted with:"
		""
		"2x &bIron Sheets&r"
		"1x &bAny Barrel&r"
	]
	quest.2E976AB705F26470.quest_subtitle: "A great place to store your items!"
	quest.2EB24D2AB31C1431.quest_desc: [
