	quest.3D4D5C92716CA74C.quest_desc: [
		"As aforementioned, having an infinite lava supply anywhere is incredibly useful."
		"You can use it to run your steam engines and heat your mixers using straws."
		"You can use it for Blaze Cakes."
		"You can use it in buckets to fuel your furnaces."
		"You can use it in buckets to fuel your ME network or Spatial IO with Vibration Chambers."
		""
		"But moving 10K blocks of a liquid that burns to the touch and eats any items it contacts seems arduous and dangerous. So now that we can harvest a natural infinite supply, how does one go about inducing mitosis? We have infinite millibuckets of lava now, but how does one move them all so we can make our own domestic one closer to home and more importantly our factories?"
		""
		"Here are some methods:"
	]
	quest.3D4D5C92716CA74C.quest_subtitle: "You mentioned lake duplication?"
	quest.3D4D5C92716CA74C.title: "Lava Lake Husbandry"
