	quest.3EAEC39431D5A055.quest_desc: [
		"The &bDiet Journal&r is a helpful book that tracks every food you've eaten. You can craft it by combining a &bBook and Quill&r with an &bApple&r, or by accepting this quest! That was easy."
		""
		"You might be wondering, why is it important to know what foods I've eaten? Well, each unique food you eat increases your &cMax Health&r! It may take a bit of munching before you start feeling different, but rest assured, you'll grow stronger!"
	]
