	quest.450C39AE75127F3A.quest_desc: ["When placed next to an inventory, it will mimic the functionality of that inventory. For example, if you place it down and then a chest onto the front face, using a hopper on the proxy to insert items would put them into the chest. This can be useful when you need to have multiple insertion points to one block."]
