	quest.49A9540C4C045C3D.quest_desc: ["The Inventory Trim acts as a sort of \"Buffer\", allowing you to chain them to connect multitudes of inventories that aren't directly touching each other. As long as the Inventory Trim is connected to the storage system, any inventory or other trim touching it will be linked into the system."]
