	quest.4A79446E7F5419E4.quest_desc: [
		"The Drakkar is purpose-built for cold water environments."
		""
		"It boasts exceptional maneuverability, and a top speed of 30 km/h."
		""
		"With seating for 11 passengers, including the captain, and a hull strength of 200 HP. Shields, adorned with banner patterns, can be attached to provide additional defense."
		""
		"With its ice-breaking ability, it proves to be a promising vessel in cold and icy oceans."
	]
